{"code": "1", "data": [{"advantages": [], "introductions": [{"code": "productIntroductionBva", "desc": "在仓储、运输过程中，托寄物丢失或损坏，按照保价金额和托寄物实际价值的投保比例，结合托寄物的实际损失金额进行赔偿。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-prod-js.png", "name": "产品介绍"}, {"code": "chargeStandardBva", "desc": "①仓储保价：针对仓储服务过程提供的保价服务。单个SKU选定保价、录入声明价值后，货物在库期间均会按照声明价值进行保价。收费标准：货物在库期间，按保价货物声明价值总和的十万分5/天收取。\n②仓运保价：针对运输服务过程提供的保价服务。单个SKU选定保价、录入声明价值后，在使用仓运服务时，如出库订单中包含已保价商品，则自动合计订单总声明价值进行保价。收费标准：最低收费2元/单，保价费率5‰。\n③医冷保价：针对医药冷链服务过程提供的保价服务。下单时选择保价、录入声明价值后，在医冷服务过程中按照声明价值进行保价。收费标准：最低收费10元/单，保价费率5‰。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-fee.png", "name": "收费标准"}, {"code": "appScopeBva", "desc": "医药商务仓、医冷零担、医药冷链产品可售卖地区。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-range.png", "name": "适用范围"}, {"code": "claimStandardBva", "desc": "客户选择保价服务后，在对应保价保障的服务期间因京东物流责任造成货物毁损、灭失的，按照货物的声明价值和损失比例进行赔偿，最高不超过货物的实际损失金额或实际价值。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-lipei-tj.png", "name": "理赔条件"}], "name": "保价服务", "productNo": "ll-a-0023", "sort": 2, "type": 2}, {"advantages": [], "introductions": [{"code": "productIntroductionBva", "desc": "基于客户需求，为客户提供将货物装上运输工具或从运输工具卸下的服务。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-prod-js.png", "name": "产品介绍"}, {"code": "chargeStandardBva", "desc": "单边收费，装、卸分别收费，收费标准：15元/方。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-fee.png", "name": "收费标准"}, {"code": "serviceScopeBva", "desc": "医药仓库园区内。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-fugai-fw.png", "name": "服务范围"}], "name": "装卸服务", "productNo": "ll-a-0038", "sort": 7, "type": 2}, {"advantages": [], "introductions": [{"code": "productIntroductionBva", "desc": "向客户提供可使用的耗材，将结合货物属性、运输距离、特殊需求、安全性等提供合适的耗材服务。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-prod-js.png", "name": "产品介绍"}, {"code": "chargeStandardBva", "desc": "<div><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/medicine/addvalue/yy-baozhuang-fee.png\"></div>", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-fee.png", "name": "收费标准"}], "name": "包装服务", "productNo": "md-a-0004", "sort": 13, "type": 2}, {"advantages": [], "introductions": [{"code": "productIntroductionBva", "desc": "①贴码服务：根据商家的需求，代贴条码/防伪码/其他标签。\n②扫药监码：根据客户需求及药监局要求，提供药品药监码记录和上传平台服务，含入库、出库双向药监码采集。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-prod-js.png", "name": "产品介绍"}, {"code": "chargeStandardBva", "desc": "按照实际操作个数，收取0.5元/个。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-fee.png", "name": "收费标准"}], "name": "贴码溯源", "productNo": "ll-a-0037", "sort": 18, "type": 2}, {"advantages": [], "introductions": [{"code": "productIntroductionBva", "desc": "提供随货同行单、药检报告单等单据打印服务。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-prod-js.png", "name": "产品介绍"}, {"code": "chargeStandardBva", "desc": "按订单维度收取，2元/单。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-fee.png", "name": "收费标准"}], "name": "单据管理", "productNo": "ll-a-0048", "sort": 23, "type": 2}, {"advantages": [], "introductions": [{"code": "productI